### Maintenance Window

You can configure a daily maintenance window to pause all data processing. This is useful for performing system updates without interrupting active jobs.

- `maintenance_start_hour`: The hour (0-23) when the maintenance window begins.
- `maintenance_end_hour`: The hour (0-23) when the maintenance window ends.

If either parameter is omitted, the feature is disabled. The window can span across midnight (e.g., start: 22, end: 4).
